id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45179::$$$message_0408_0000_0000$$$::"We won!"::
45180::$$$message_0408_0000_0001$$$::"Naturally."::
45181::$$$message_0408_0000_0002$$$::"..."::
45182::$$$message_0408_0000_0003$$$::"...Cheer up, Lancer. It's only a superstition that crying causes moles to appear under your eyes."::
45183::$$$message_0408_0000_0004$$$::"My wish...has finally been realized. [br]No, it has been since I was summoned to this land..."::
45184::$$$message_0408_0000_0005$$$::"Ha! Don't get ahead of yourself. This ridiculous war will be but a footnote when we return home. I still have plenty of work for you."::
45185::$$$message_0408_0000_0006$$$::"As you wish, my lord."::
45186::$$$message_0408_0000_0007$$$::"Now, let us go in triumph to my new workshop."::
45187::$$$message_0408_0000_0008$$$::"And the onsen, too. Don't forget the mixed bath."::
45188::$$$message_0408_0000_0009$$$::"Of course, my love."эЈяе